Origin of this repository
-------------------------

This repository is based on source code obtained by decompiling
MegaDownloader v1.8, originally created by Andres Soliño. The decompiled
code has been repaired and maintained here for the sole purpose of restoring
compatibility with MEGA's current link formats (mega.nz/file/,
mega.nz/folder/), which the original release can no longer parse.

本仓库基于 MegaDownloader v1.8 的反编译源码进行修复与维护，目的在于恢复其对
MEGA 新版链接格式（mega.nz/file/、mega.nz/folder/）的兼容性，使已停止维护的
原版软件重新可用。


